    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Catch the Y2K Bug:</h2>It\u2019s New Year\u2019s in the new millennium and someone forgot to update the office computers, unleashing an unstoppable bug. You play the part of a power hungry computer,  armed with the most advanced arsenal\u2026of floppy disks and keyboards. Hit the mall, pop into a laundromat, and stop by your neighborhood video store as you navigate throwback maps and use fun power-ups in the fight of your life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer Mayhem:</h2>Compete from your couch with 4-player local multiplayer or play online with this cool new cutting edge tech called the \u201cworld wide web.\u201d Challenge yourself with four different game modes: Brawler, Capture the Plug, Cyber Blitz, and Blackout.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cable Management:</h2>Power cables will only get you so far before you reach their limit. Unplug and find a new outlet when you need some juice. Move and maneuver, but watch that power cord \u2013 you don't want to get unplugged!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power to the Outlet:</h2>When you plug into an outlet, you pull energy from the room around you, changing the map as you play. Keep your power level in mind as you attack and retreat, and don\u2019t forget to defend your outlet! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feng Shui your way:</h2>Is that pesky office chair in the way? Hate taking calls at your desk? Whack your problems away with your keyboard and let physics do the rest. Turn obstacles into opportunities and reshape your digital battleground!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Catch the Y2K Bug:</h2>It\u2019s New Year\u2019s in the new millennium and someone forgot to update the office computers, unleashing an unstoppable bug. You play the part of a power hungry computer,  armed with the most advanced arsenal\u2026of floppy disks and keyboards. Hit the mall, pop into a laundromat, and stop by your neighborhood video store as you navigate throwback maps and use fun power-ups in the fight of your life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer Mayhem:</h2>Compete from your couch with 4-player local multiplayer or play online with this cool new cutting edge tech called the \u201cworld wide web.\u201d Challenge yourself with four different game modes: Brawler, Capture the Plug, Cyber Blitz, and Blackout.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/b4329aa281c56e64b95fb3efeb43134a.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cable Management:</h2>Power cables will only get you so far before you reach their limit. Unplug and find a new outlet when you need some juice. Move and maneuver, but watch that power cord \u2013 you don't want to get unplugged!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power to the Outlet:</h2>When you plug into an outlet, you pull energy from the room around you, changing the map as you play. Keep your power level in mind as you attack and retreat, and don\u2019t forget to defend your outlet! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/863af449c5dbe7359cd6980a3ed16e97.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feng Shui your way:</h2>Is that pesky office chair in the way? Hate taking calls at your desk? Whack your problems away with your keyboard and let physics do the rest. Turn obstacles into opportunities and reshape your digital battleground!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.poster.avif?t=1736014932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.webm?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079820/extras/315687a45182518f3720a5454ede9274.mp4?t=1736014932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
